            "review_title": "Review at Dimsum Hongkong Street",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nGreat Dim Sum...Very Reasonably Priced!\nNov 2018 • Couples\nIn a city that is just chock-full of dining options, Dim Sum Hong Kong is a great place for, well, yes, dim sum. We tried six different options and, while we did have our favorites, we really loved everything we ordered and would absolutely go back for another go. With so many places to try in Hanoi these days, there's always an incredible pull to try new places rather than return to ones I've tried previously. But, for some reason, I get regular cravings for dim sum and now I know that this place is super-reliable!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 12, 2018",
